<title>NETHERLANDS: NEDSCHROEF 1996 PROFIT MARGINALLY DOWN.</title>
<headline>NEDSCHROEF 1996 PROFIT MARGINALLY DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    17.03 vs  17.76</p>
<p>    Net profit			    12.9  vs  13.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  6.30 vs   6.30</p>
<p>    Turnover			     338.4  vs 312.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    19.6  vs  14.8</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.4  vs   1.8</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains		  nil  vs   2.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Screws and bolts maker Nedschroef Holding previously</p>
<p>said it expected higher profits from ordinary ops in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
